WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.071
Welcome! Today you learn the German alphabet. It has
twenty-six letters, plus ä, ö, ü and ß.

2
00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:14.449
ah

3
00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:15.018
eh

4
00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:15.634
ee

5
00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:16.290
oh

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:16.814
oo

7
00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:19.859
ä as in Käse (cheese)

8
00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:20.939
ö as in schön (beautiful)

9
00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:21.879
ü as in Tür (door)

10
00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:23.310
ß as in Straße (street)

11
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:37.163
Watch out! E and I together sound like “ai”: Wein. I and E
together is a long i: Wien. E and U sound like “oi”:
Deutsch. W sounds like v: wie. And Z sounds like “ts”: Zeit.

12
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.440
What is your surname?

13
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:42.534
Pérez.

14
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.475
How do you spell that?

15
00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:47.129
P – E – R – E – Z.

16
00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:53.001
Now it's your turn. Listen and repeat.

17
00:01:11.967 --> 00:01:14.660
Listen carefully and point to the right picture!

18
00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:20.447
der Umlaut

19
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.100
der Buchstabe

20
00:01:30.533 --> 00:01:32.358
What's correct? Think for a moment!

21
00:01:36.733 --> 00:01:38.700
W is said “vay”, like a v.

22
00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:43.858
What's correct? Think for a moment!

23
00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:50.990
eu and äu sound like “oi”: Deutsch, heute.

24
00:01:54.533 --> 00:01:58.386
Great! Now spell your name out loud. See you next time!
